# Demo bundle resources are staged here at build time by stage-resources.sh
# (scene.lite.js, cubes.glb, environmentSpecular.env, ...) and copied into the .app.
# They are generated/downloaded artifacts, so ignore everything in this folder EXCEPT
# the files we intentionally commit: brdf-lut.png (ships with the repo) and the
# .gitkeep placeholder that keeps the otherwise-empty folder in git.
*
!.gitignore
!.gitkeep
!brdf-lut.png
